    "longDescription": "Learn Python the easy way with interactive tutorials, coding exercises, and quizzes.\n Whether you’re just starting out or looking to sharpen your programming skills, this app guides you step by step.\nWith our hands-on lessons, you’ll go from writing your very first “hello world” code to building more advanced projects. The built-in code editor lets you practice right inside the app, so you can experiment, test, and improve without switching tools.\nFeatures:\nStep-by-step Python tutorials for beginners and intermediate learners\n\n\nInteractive coding exercises and quizzes to test your knowledge\n\n\nBuilt-in code editor for real-time practice\n\n\nSelf-paced learning modules so you can learn at your own speed\n\n\nPractical examples to help you apply programming in real scenarios\n\n\nWhether you’re a student, a professional, or just curious about coding, this app makes learning engaging, fun, and effective. Think of it as your personal Sololearn-style Masterclass for Python programming.\nStart your journey today and build the skills to create your own projects!\nDisclaimer:\n This app is not affiliated with the Python Software Foundation. “Python” is a registered trademark of the Python Software Foundation.",
